  "primary": "A projectile flies in an arc where you look and explodes in a 3.5-block radius on hit. The explosion comes 0.6 s after impact. 4 shards scatter around with the same effects on creatures they touch. Effects:\n• Damage 1.25 ❤ fire + 1.25 ❤ earth + 1.25 ❤ arcane (fire ×0.5 on wet, earth ×2 on frozen)\n• Heat: sets on fire for 6 s (wet targets just dry off), thaws; melts ice and burns roots\n• Light push\n• Breaks up to 3 blocks within 0.5 blocks (twice as many if brittle)\n• Arcane instability: −0.25 ❤ every 2 s for 4.5 s\n• Leaves a 2-block zone for 5 s that repeats these effects every second\n• Withering: −0.5 ❤ per second for 4 s\n• Life drain: 0.5 ❤ damage, you heal 0.2 ❤",
  "self_description": "On you:\n• Damage 1.25 ❤ fire (fire ×0.5 on wet)\n• Heat: sets on fire for 6 s (wet targets just dry off), thaws; melts ice and burns roots\n• Stone skin (Resistance I) for 7 s\n• Slowness I for 5.5 s\n• Arcane instability: −0.25 ❤ every 2 s for 4.5 s\n• Withering: −0.5 ❤ per second for 3 s",
